            <ArticleTitle>Bronchial thermoplasty: a novel therapy for severe asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>437-44</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.ccm.2013.03.003</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0272-5231(13)00047-6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents an overview of bronchial thermoplasty, a novel treatment for severe asthma. Within, the authors discuss the rationale for bronchial thermoplasty in severe asthma, current clinical evidence for the use of this procedure, clinical recommendations, and future directions.</AbstractText>
